  "description": "Ambitious and exceptionally skilled, Gi Se-Na, the divorce specialist who became every rookie lawyer's role model! She endured hardships to proudly inherit her father's law firm, finally securing a partner position... Only to have some tiger-like bastard snatch it away. But that tiger-faced bastard is Ryu Kang-Hyeon, the senior who witnessed Se-Na's embarrassing past in her twenties? She has to successfully marry such a person to inherit the firm?\n\nI have plenty of divorce experience, but I know nothing about romance!\n\nThe romance between the unpredictable, ambitious Se-Na and the inscrutable senior Kang-Hyeon begins.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
